VALUES ('f2400556-5c22-5751-b499-967cc94bdef3', '2bac6bf6-8667-5a98-8e61-7f4a9a520fbe', '3ee0cd78-35ee-5b4c-98e2-8597eb89b046', '84af5bc0-d8bc-5df3-b1a1-e2f2a8379b47', 'Rate Type', 'Classifies the business purpose and provenance context of the exchange rate. Used to select an appropriate rate according to transaction and accounting policy. Different workflows may require different rate types; a spot rate must not automatically replace a contractual or accounting rate. Controls which rate is eligible for a conversion event. Market or transaction-time conversion rate. Rate established by an agreement or commercial contract. Published daily rate for a defined business date. Published rate intended for a defined monthly reporting period. Rate designated by accounting policy for ledger translation or reporting. Controlled rate established for a specific business purpose. Required to preserve conversion context. Required — the record cannot be saved while this is empty.', 50, 50, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
