VALUES ('a1e1c53c-8ce3-53da-a3a1-b84214e78fcf', '39bd59db-7196-5c04-a974-242280bc7f6d', 'maintenance_type', 'Maintenance Type', 'Captures the business meaning of maintenance type for the MaintenancePlan. It is interpreted together with the entity''s other attributes and relationships to support the processes that manage this record. Used when creating, reviewing, searching, validating, reporting on, or integrating MaintenancePlan records, where applicable. Its meaning is specific to MaintenancePlan; it must be interpreted with the entity''s relationships, lifecycle, and business rules rather than as an isolated technical value. Represents the preventive state or classification in the context of MaintenancePlan. Represents the condition based state or classification in the context of MaintenancePlan. Represents the predictive state or classification in the context of MaintenancePlan. Represents the inspection state or classification in the context of MaintenancePlan. Required because the business model cannot reliably interpret the record for its declared purpose without this value.', 1010, NULL, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 40, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
