VALUES ('a991e9ca-fb63-5384-b1fe-1d7f77d31736', '002bd77f-49f9-5d1a-a659-bb1eca289ac5', '38754501-94ca-5817-a4d2-7bb860515154', '84af5bc0-d8bc-5df3-b1a1-e2f2a8379b47', 'Frequency Unit', 'Captures the business meaning of frequency unit for the MaintenancePlan. It is interpreted together with the entity''s other attributes and relationships to support the processes that manage this record. Used when creating, reviewing, searching, validating, reporting on, or integrating MaintenancePlan records, where applicable. Its meaning is specific to MaintenancePlan; it must be interpreted with the entity''s relationships, lifecycle, and business rules rather than as an isolated technical value. Represents the hours state or classification in the context of MaintenancePlan. Represents the days state or classification in the context of MaintenancePlan. Represents the weeks state or classification in the context of MaintenancePlan. Represents the months state or classification in the context of MaintenancePlan. Represents the miles state or classification in the context of MaintenancePlan. Represents the cycles state or classification in the context of MaintenancePlan. Represents the other state or classification in the context of MaintenancePlan. Optional because the business concept can remain valid when this value is not yet known or is not applicable.', 60, 60, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
